    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax Sii Sheegid Ka Gees Ah Masar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana sannaddii tobnaad, bisheedii tobnaad, maalinteedii laba iyo tobnaad ayaa eraygii Rabbigu ii yimid isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, wejigaaga u jeedi Fircoon oo ah boqorka Masar, oo waxaad wax ka sii sheegtaa isaga iyo dalka Masar oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "La hadal oo waxaad ku tidhaahdaa, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Fircoonow, boqorka Masarow, anigu col baan kugu ahaye bal ogow, waxaad tahay yaxaas weyn oo webiyaashiisa iska dhex jiifa, oo yidhi, Webigayga anigaa iska leh, oo anigaa samaystay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse qabatooyin baan camanka kaa soo sudhi doonaa, oo kalluunka webiyaashaadana waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inuu qolfahaaga ku dhego, oo webiyaashaadaan kaa soo bixin doonaa adiga iyo kalluunka webiyaashaada ee qolfahaaga ku wada dhegi doona oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo adiga iyo kalluunka webiyaashaada oo dhanba cidladaan ku tuuri doonaa. Waxaad ku dhici doontaa berrin bannaan, oo innaba layskuma soo kaa ururin doono, lagumana aasi doono, oo waxaan cunto kaaga dhigay dugaagga dhulka iyo haadka samada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadka Masar deggan oo dhammu way wada ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay, maxaa yeelay, iyagu waxay reer binu Israa'iil u ahaayeen ul cawsduur ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markay gacanta kugu qaateen waad jabtay, oo waxaad murkicisay garbahoodii oo dhan, oo markay ku cuskadeenna waad kala jabtay, oo dhexdoodii oo dhanna waad gariirisay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogow, waxaan dushaada ku soo dayn doonaa seef, oo dad iyo duunyaba waan kaa dhex baabbi'in doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalka Masar wuxuu noqon doonaa cidla iyo baabba' oo iyagu waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu Rabbiga ahay, maxaa yeelay, isagu wuxuu yidhi, Webiga anigaa iska leh, oo anigaa samaystay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidaas daraaddeed bal ogow, anigu col baan kugu ahay adiga iyo webiyaashaadaba, oo dalka Masarna waxaan ka dhigi doonaa baabba' iyo cidla, tan iyo munaaradda. Migdol iyo ilaa Seweeneeh, iyo xataa ilaa soohdinta Itoobiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innaba binu-aadmi cagtiis ma dhex mari doonto, oo xayawaan cagtiisna ma dhex mari doonto, oo intii afartan sannadood ah ciduna dhexdiisa ma degi doonto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dalka Masar ayaan waddammada cidlada ah dhexdooda cidla kaga dhigi doonaa, oo magaalooyinkiisuna afartan sannadood ayay magaalooyinka baabba'ay cidla ku dhex ahaan doonaan, oo Masriyiintana quruumaha dhexdooda ayaan ku kala dhex eryi doonaa, oo waxaan ku dhex firdhin doonaa waddammada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Markay afartan sannadood dhammaadaan ayaan Masriyiinta dadyowgii ay ku kala dhex firidhsanaayeen ka soo ururin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maxaabiista Masar baan soo celin doonaa, oo waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inay dalkii Fatroos oo ah dalkii ay ku dhasheen ku noqdaan, oo waxay halkaas ku ahaan doonaan boqortooyo hoosaysa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay ahaan doontaa tan boqortooyooyinka ugu wada hoosaysa, oo mar dambena quruumaha kale iskama ay kor marin doonto. Iyagaan u dhimi doonaa si ayan innaba mar dambe quruumaha ugu talin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo mar dambena siima ay ahaan doonto kalsoonidii reer binu Israa'iil taasoo xumaantoodii soo xusuusisa markay xaggooda fiiriyaanba, oo waxay ogaan doonaan inaan anigu ahay Sayidka Rabbiga ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana sannaddii toddoba iyo labaatanaad, bisheedii kowaad, maalinteedii kowaad ayaa eraygii Rabbigu ii yimid, isagoo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilka Aadamow, Nebukadresar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon ciidankiisuu hawl weyn oo Turos ka gees ah ka shaqaysiiyey. Madax kasta wuu bidaaroobay, oo garab kastana wuu diirmay, laakiinse isaga iyo ciidankiisii toona Turos mushahaaro uu hawshii iyada ka gees ahayd ka shaqeeyey kama ay helin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, waxaan dalka Masar siin doonaa Nebukadresar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon, oo isaguna wuxuu qaadan doonaa barwaaqadeeda, oo maalkeedana wuu boobi doonaa, oo xoolaheedana booli ahaan buu u kaxaysan doonaa, oo mushahaaro bay ciidankiisa u noqon doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dalka Masar ayaan isaga u siiyey hawshiisii uu hawshooday aawadeed, maxaa yeelay, aniga ayay ii shaqeeyeen ayaa Sayidka Rabbiga ahu leeyahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.29.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
